[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14941.03, "timestamp": "04:09:01", "text": "比如经过验证的电话号码之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14943.59, "timestamp": "04:09:03", "text": "一切。所以，我就是在那里跟人谈的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14947.189, "timestamp": "04:09:07", "text": "关于这个机器人问题。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14950.79, "timestamp": "04:09:10", "text": "所以，是的，其中一个也是，所有也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14952.95, "timestamp": "04:09:12", "text": "讲述了以下情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14957.11, "timestamp": "04:09:17", "text": "我和聊天对象聊了很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14961.51, "timestamp": "04:09:21", "text": "印度人，他们都有追随者哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14963.83, "timestamp": "04:09:23", "text": "然后我就想，好吧，如果是的话就关注吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14966.07, "timestamp": "04:09:26", "text": "仅限关注者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14968.309, "timestamp": "04:09:28", "text": "不，更像是你看，我不想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14971.11, "timestamp": "04:09:31", "text": "关注，更像是我想和人们在一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14978.469, "timestamp": "04:09:38", "text": "我以为人们会像擦拭一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14980.71, "timestamp": "04:09:40", "text": "检查一下，好的，他们观察了1分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14982.389, "timestamp": "04:09:42", "text": "一分钟或30秒。好的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14985.03, "timestamp": "04:09:45", "text": "如果主播感兴趣的话，那也没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14987.51, "timestamp": "04:09:47", "text": "然后他们跟着，说话就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14992.63, "timestamp": "04:09:52", "text": "对话或一些正确的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14995.51, "timestamp": "04:09:55", "text": "查询需要交互。"}]